  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Should I file an insurance claim?</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Not always. Filing a claim can impact your record and future premiums. Before filing, you should understand whether the damage exceeds your deductible and whether the loss is clearly covered.</p></div>


  
