  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">What is Actual Cash Value vs Replacement Cost?</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Actual Cash Value (ACV) deducts depreciation. Replacement Cost Value (RCV) covers the full cost to replace the item, subject to policy terms and conditions.</p></div>


  
