  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Do I need a public adjuster?</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Not necessarily. Many homeowners can successfully manage their own claims when they understand the process and policy language.</p></div>


  
