  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><a href="/about"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black"><strong>About&nbsp;</strong></span><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black"><strong>ClaimHelpMe</strong>®</span></a></h3><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Most claim problems don’t start with coverage—they start with misunderstanding the process.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">This platform breaks down how insurance claims actually work, using real-world scenarios to show what’s included, what’s missed, and why outcomes change.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><a target="_blank" href="mailto:claimhelpme@gmail.com?"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--white">claimhelpme@gmail.com</span></a></p></div>


  
